---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Brand from '../components/Brand.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Talk to Zach at packsel about your warehouse, mobile robot leasing, and the next step toward automation.">
<div class="interior">
<section class="page-hero"><p class="page-eyebrow">Let’s talk.</p><h1>Start with<br />your warehouse.</h1><p class="page-deck">Tell <Brand tm /> what you’re moving,<br />and what you’d like to improve.</p></section>
<section class="content-wrap split-feature" style="align-items:start;padding-bottom:96px"><div class="contact-surface" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">Your point of contact.</p><h2>Zach</h2><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:zach@packsel.co">zach@packsel.co</a><p>Send a floor plan, describe a workflow, or ask a question. We’ll start with a conversation about fit.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:zach@packsel.co?subject=Warehouse%20automation%20enquiry&body=Hi%20Zach%2C%0A%0AI%E2%80%99d%20like%20to%20discuss%20automation%20for%20our%20warehouse.%0A%0ACompany%3A%0ALocation%3A%0ACurrent%20workflow%3A%0AMain%20challenge%3A%0A">Start an email</a><p class="email-note">Opens your email app.</p></div><div data-reveal><h2 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:8px">Give us a picture<br />of your operation.</h2><ul class="clean-list"><li><strong>Where you work</strong>Warehouse location and approximate size.</li><li><strong>How work moves</strong>Picking process, team size, shifts, and daily volume.</li><li><strong>What needs to change</strong>Your WMS and the main constraint you want to solve.</li></ul><a class="contact-link-row" href="/warehouse-demo/"><span>Still exploring?</span><strong>Walk through the warehouse demo</strong></a><a class="contact-link-row" href="/savings/"><span>Building a business case?</span><strong>Try the savings calculator</strong></a></div></section>
</div>
</Base>
